  "key": "SFCC-279",
  "summary": "Cart Behaviour – Cart Persistence Configuration (Guest 30 Days, Authenticated 6 Months)",
  "description": "As a Site Admin, I want cart persistence configured to 30 days for guest shoppers and 6 months for authenticated shoppers in SFCC Business Manager, so that customer baskets are retained for the correct duration.\n\nThis is a Business Manager configuration story — not a frontend build. Cart persistence is measured from the last basket interaction (e.g. adding, removing, or updating an item, or opening the cart), not from when an individual product was first added. The timer resets on each interaction.\n\nNo designs required.",
